{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$j : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-groupoid-pre-equivalence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:85a143fd9afe068a05c2fe8e96757403574860e530c75cab4e4240acbd5c2660", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8d824ac9d5d5c2da1f4f374b85dadbb57191170ec0f93502697d188c85a39e00", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nGiven a groupoid in algebraic spaces <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>\nthe morphism <MATH_0004> is a pre-equivalence\nrelation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bf45cc171032623cd57d6b14de9b6dd028391ea0a17fe855f4b2d3b10df0b910", "unit_id": "tag:043X:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e997bc0c3774e716a98d5b34fe82a57e8767c2a11cdec919820cecc217c5a9ad", "source_text": "Omitted.\nThis is a nice exercise in the definitions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ee55be257e364480adff56bf51d1f520300c175cbf8b2686034c071d513012c", "unit_id": "tag:043X:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$j : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-equivalence-groupoid}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1abc671b4e8bbb6fcf4f822a83fc86d88ceed1a19ccc417a185ff7c77bfc0185", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:20076cfcd85d7d721e99f3da01da61205c01d59e5583813d6f52fcecd8b37443", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nGiven an equivalence relation <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>\nthere is a unique way to extend it to a groupoid in algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0004> over <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:54af6e22e395214aca775f7d1b45a185cc5f5cecd7bd9704768f91893699477a", "unit_id": "tag:043Y:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e997bc0c3774e716a98d5b34fe82a57e8767c2a11cdec919820cecc217c5a9ad", "source_text": "Omitted.\nThis is a nice exercise in the definitions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ee55be257e364480adff56bf51d1f520300c175cbf8b2686034c071d513012c", "unit_id": "tag:043Y:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n& U & \\\\\nR \\ar[d]_s \\ar[ru]^t &\nR \\times_{s, U, t} R\n\\ar[l]^-{\\text{pr}_0} \\ar[d]^{\\text{pr}_1} \\ar[r]_-c &\nR \\ar[d]^s \\ar[lu]_t \\\\\nU & R \\ar[l]_t \\ar[r]^s & U\n}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-diagram}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ac8b63aade7b86245f945a5a74228bf86146352e604e449ae016c2da6f97bdef", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:acaa8b256a9ae38e96388e5d7e8920ab628c26b5b105792c3933e338543cdc5f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nIn the commutative diagram\n<MATH_0004>\nthe two lower squares are fibre product squares.\nMoreover, the triangle on top (which is really a square)\nis also cartesian.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:617a2ac06cc431532b46172a5872a31ffec39d179cdfa4d8c83aa850ed1dbc22", "unit_id": "tag:043Z:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e997bc0c3774e716a98d5b34fe82a57e8767c2a11cdec919820cecc217c5a9ad", "source_text": "Omitted.\nExercise in the definitions and the functorial point of\nview in algebraic geometry.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:81802deccb55840a657c27b497709bb12fe88615a50a33297d87f9fae5445f4d", "unit_id": "tag:043Z:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(U, R, s, t, c, e, i)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-pull}\n\\xymatrix{\nR \\times_{t, U, t} R\n\\ar@<1ex>[r]^-{\\text{pr}_1} \\ar@<-1ex>[r]_-{\\text{pr}_0}\n\\ar[d]_{\\text{pr}_0 \\times c \\circ (i, 1)} &\nR \\ar[r]^t \\ar[d]^{\\text{id}_R} &\nU \\ar[d]^{\\text{id}_U} \\\\\nR \\times_{s, U, t} R\n\\ar@<1ex>[r]^-c \\ar@<-1ex>[r]_-{\\text{pr}_0} \\ar[d]_{\\text{pr}_1} &\nR \\ar[r]^t \\ar[d]^s &\nU \\\\\nR \\ar@<1ex>[r]^s \\ar@<-1ex>[r]_t &\nU\n}\n\\end{equation}", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-diagram-pull}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7efc83cf3bab4a519538382107895a1e182dbbdb921bc11d5620c9a272652fd3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5ca8eedbfdd9b70c6714f62e68236015f77eb6a2f200a996d3d033000cb4114d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nThe diagram\n<MATH_0004>\nis commutative. The two top rows are isomorphic via the vertical maps given.\nThe two lower left squares are cartesian.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:88b2f8de23c7da7210218cbb1f0bb6e0bb4a1b1db86a57748cfee56a185ff2a8", "unit_id": "tag:0450:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "043V", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\alpha, \\beta)$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\alpha, \\alpha^{-1} \\circ \\beta)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\text{Arrows} \\times_{t, \\text{Ob}, t} \\text{Arrows}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\text{Arrows} \\times_{s, \\text{Ob}, t} \\text{Arrows}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-diagram}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e0d4cfade223c2b26501e72f4ac7ddfabcb7bf085ce11aa7df22a6b21ceb0d29", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:283a904a0f2993aec56fb2106170af60050f02dcd4ddf440e0737e0a8a367ae5", "source_text": "The commutativity of the diagram follows from the axioms of a groupoid.\nNote that, in terms of groupoids, the top left vertical arrow assigns to\na pair of morphisms <MATH_0001> with the same target, the pair\nof morphisms <MATH_0002>. In any groupoid\nthis defines a bijection between\n<MATH_0003>\nand\n<MATH_0004>. Hence the second\nassertion of the lemma.\nThe last assertion follows from Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9bc41d1f65eba399e2590d88c532fe65614ec0c418d92e52b3bdbf048dc7cd63", "unit_id": "tag:0450:proof"}
